# Wildwood Scourge: only creatures its controller controls. An opponent's Walking Ballista entering with a counter does nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Wildwood Scourge
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Walking Ballista
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Wildwood Scourge.Cast(X: 2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Wildwood Scourge.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Walking Ballista.Cast(X: 1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Walking Ballista.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Wildwood Scourge.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Stack.Count = 0
